Jc6fmdPJ","user":{"login":"MrMinimal","id":8739690,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Mzk2OTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8739690?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal","html_url":"https://github.com/MrMinimal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T07:54:40Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T07:54:40Z","body":"> It looks more like an importer issue. Can you output glTF from blender?\n\nI am not exporting from Blender manually, I use the automatic Blender import in Godot.\nGiven that, I don't know what the export settings are that Godot calls Blender with to generate gltf.\n\nDoing it manually without changing any settings in Blender I get this: \n[gltf_export_from_blender_unknown_settings.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18937991/gltf_export_from_blender_unknown_settings.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2677658569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2677927102","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103211#issuecomment-2677927102","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103211","id":2677927102,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fney-","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T10:01:41Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T10:19:11Z","body":"I previewed the glTF file on the VSCode and the issue already occurs at the glTF. The blender importer in godot only imports it as a glTF via blender's glTF export, so there doesn't seem to be any way to fix it on the Godot side.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7233c54-c230-452e-a44e-39119dbbf650)\n\nThe Blender glTF-io repository is [here](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Blender-IO/issues), so probably you can forward the issue there.\n\nBy the way, the only change between 4.3 and 4.4 related to this issue is the default value for snaps for the animation player editor, and even in 4.3, this issue still should be occurring when normal playback is done instead of scrubbing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2677927102/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2677996713","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103211#issuecomment-2677996713","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103211","id":2677996713,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fnvyp","user":{"login":"MrMinimal","id":8739690,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Mzk2OTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8739690?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal","html_url":"https://github.com/MrMinimal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMinimal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T10:28:05Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T10:28:05Z","body":"@TokageItLab thank you for looking into this! You are right, scrubbing in the AnimationPlayer in Godot 4.3 doesn't show the bug but playing it does!\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67fbf8ee-a39c-49af-bcc6-41db2d64d32d)\n\nI will update the issue and post it to the exporter. Thanks a lot!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2677996713/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,